---
title: "receive (Sui Framework: transfer)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: Receiving(id, version) destructured
    q_destruct --> q_receive: receive_impl(parent.to_address(), id, version)
    q_receive --> [*]: return received object T

    note right of q_destruct
        INV-001: requires mutable access to parent UID (proves ownership)
        INV-002: Receiving is ephemeral (per-transaction, cannot be stored)
        INV-003: receive() restricted to defining module (bytecode verifier)
        INV-004: public_receive() requires key + store
        INV-005: version check prevents replay
    end note
